MoS: Mixed-Start Flow Matching for Action Generation

This distribution contains modifications to NVIDIA Isaac-GR00T for conditional
semantic flow sources, strict past-only action-history alignment, mixed-source
consistency supervision, deployment controls, open-loop evaluation, and release
validation. The upstream source and third-party dependencies retain their
original copyright and license notices. See ATTRIBUTIONS.md.

The official mos_best and mos_best_no_mem model cards, datasets, and reported
open-loop results are research artifacts. They are not a robot-safety certification.
DROID data and model/data dependencies remain subject to their original terms.
